{"seq":14,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r5","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:13:26.946Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"e798508b2553d0ea7123b1dbbeb878084ab87afa45daf3351115a1d4047d6a77","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here's what Moss's Strategic digests say. Two of the four owners are only implied, not named.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's industrial account until it was reassigned in the CRM on **2026-05-04**. Moss's 5/3 prep note says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04\", and the 5/4 digest confirms the reassignment effective that date. The 8/3 digest calls it \"Gideon's biggest account\".\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The 12/1/2025 and 4/27 digests call it \"Gideon's fleet account\". The 5/4 digest adds that he \"also assumed management\" of it that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato, though only indirectly. The 9/30 digest lists an action item under \"Gideon's medical account\" and describes Orlavine as a medical account at 55 seats. It never names the owner next to Orlavine.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't state an owner. The 9/30 digest has Nadia volunteering to host QFO's gate-clerk training, but that doesn't make her the owner. I couldn't find an account profile for QFO either. Please confirm it in the CRM before it goes on the slide.\n\nThe 9/15/2025 digest says Gideon \"took over\" a medical account in August 2025, which is a separate event. I didn't use it for the Vantorre Group date."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
